  "body": "Beautifully updated throughout, this stylish BRICK CONSTRUCTION home feels modern, fresh and incredibly welcoming from the moment you step inside.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the stunning modern kitchen - a real standout and the perfect centrepiece for family life and entertaining. The open-plan layout where the kitchen, dining and living area flow effortlessly out to the balcony, with a fantastic outlook across Gulf Harbour and the surrounding greenery.\r\n\r\nBright, spacious and filled with natural light, the home has a relaxed feel throughout, with three generous sized bedrooms and plenty of room for families to spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nBut one of the biggest highlights is what sits just beyond the back gate.\r\n\r\nStep straight out onto the reserve, giving the kids extra space to play, an easy spot to walk the dog, and a fantastic connection through towards Gulf Harbour Marina. From home, you're only a few minutes' walk from the marina, shops, great cafes and restaurants, making it easy to enjoy everything this coastal community has to offer.\r\n\r\nYou're also close to excellent local schools, parks, playgrounds, beaches and coastal walks. Shakespear Regional Park is only a short drive away - perfect for swimming, picnics, walking tracks and enjoying some of the best coastal scenery on the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nFor those who love life on the water, the Gulf Harbour Boat Ramp and marina are close by, giving you easy access to boating, fishing, kayaking, paddleboarding and plenty of other water sports. Whether you're heading out for a morning coffee by the marina, dinner close to home, relaxing on the balcony taking in the outlook, an adventure or simply enjoying a relaxed day by the water, this is exactly what Gulf Harbour living is all about.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out ! Give us a call today for a viewing!",
